OL,3,GNEWSAM60 closure leaves drivers
OL,4,Astranded for hours
OL,5,
OL,6,FCatherine Kedward was travelling from
OL,7,FAtherton to Chadderton on Sunday with
OL,8,Fher five-year-old daughter. After
OL,9,Fleaving the motorway at Whitefield, a
OL,10,F20-minute journey turned into a
OL,11,Fsix-and-a-half-hour diversion.
